    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Survey Overview\"\nsubtitle: \"About the CanHealth 2024 Fictitious National Health Survey\"\n---\n\n\n\n## What is CanHealth 2024?\n\nCanHealth 2024 is a **fictitious** national health survey created to demonstrate\nthe Quarto + DuckDB + Plotly data portal framework. It simulates the structure\nof real population health surveys such as the Canadian Community Health Survey (CCHS).\n\n::: {.stat-callout}\n**Portal last generated:** 2026\\-06\\-16  \n**Respondents:** 5\\,000  \n**Aggregated output files:** 7\n:::\n\n---\n\n## Survey design\n\n| Feature | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| **Survey name** | CanHealth 2024 (Fictitious) |\n| **Reference population** | Canadian residents aged 18 and older |\n| **Sample size** | 5,000 synthetic respondents |\n| **Sampling design** | Simulated stratified by province and age |\n| **Survey weight** | Post-stratification weight (mean ≈ 1.0, log-normal noise) |\n| **Data collection mode** | Simulated — see `scripts/generate_data.py` |\n| **Microdata format** | Apache Parquet (columnar, compressed) |\n\n---\n\n## Sample distribution by province\n\n::: {#6ae57643 .cell execution_count=2}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display}\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"height:430px; width:100%;\">            <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/2.7.5/MathJax.js?config=TeX-AMS-MML_SVG\"></script><script>if (window.MathJax && window.MathJax.Hub && window.MathJax.Hub.Config) {window.MathJax.Hub.Config({SVG: {font: \"STIX-Web\"}});}</script>                <script>window.PlotlyConfig = {MathJaxConfig: 'local'};</script>\n        <script charset=\"utf-8\" src=\"https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-3.6.0.min.js\" integrity=\"sha256-QaOVwtVY0T02VaHrr6pnoHLCwayMJp4O5n4YyaE3rJk=\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>                <div id=\"ce2b39fc-4981-4cc0-801e-7743c244ecae\" class=\"plotly-graph-div\" style=\"height:100%; width:100%;\"></div>            <script>                window.PLOTLYENV=window.PLOTLYENV || {};